  "changes_data": [
    {
      "diff": "@@ -39,13 +39,27 @@ The following bugs have been fixed:\n //* cveidlink:2014-2486[]\n //* Wireshark took a bite out of each of your freshly baked muffins until it found the perfect one. {notable}\n \n+* Wireshark Version 4.6.6 - File Capture Properties is excessively slow and hangs Wireshark on Windows. wsbuglink:21337[].\n+* Wireshark misdecodes S-NSSAI location validity information IE (5G NAS) wsbuglink:21411[].\n+* Wireshark misdecodes NSAG information IE (5G NAS) wsbuglink:21412[].\n+* Fuzz job UTF-8 encoding issue: fuzz-2026-07-17-15393056954.pcap. wsbuglink:21419[].\n+* Wireshark misdecodes UE security capability IE (5G NAS) wsbuglink:21431[].\n+* Wireshark misdecodes Registration wait range IE (5G NAS) wsbuglink:21432[].\n+* Wireshark misdecodes Extended CAG information IE (5G NAS) wsbuglink:21433[].\n+* Stack buffer overflow in K12/RF5 writer. wsbuglink:21436[].\n+* Deep NetLog JSON nesting exhausts the native stack. wsbuglink:21462[].\n+* androiddump signed btsnoop length causes global out-of-bounds read. wsbuglink:21464[].\n+* Wireshark misdecodes SOR transparent container IE (5G NAS) wsbuglink:21472[].\n+* Unbounded Daintree timestamp fraction causes signed integer overflow. wsbuglink:21473[].\n+* Wireshark misdecodes SOR-CMCI of SOR transparent container IE (5G NAS) wsbuglink:21477[].\n+* Wireshark misdecodes Service level AA container (5GSM NAS) wsbuglink:21479[].\n \n // == Known Bugs\n \n === New and Updated Features\n \n-* The Windows installers now ship with Qt 6.7.3.\n-  They previously shipped with Qt 6.5.3.\n+// * The Windows installers now ship with Qt 6.7.3.\n+//   They previously shipped with Qt 6.5.3.\n \n // === Removed Features and Support\n \n@@ -58,9 +72,23 @@ There are no new protocols in this release.\n === Updated Protocol Support\n \n // Add one protocol per line between the -- delimiters.\n-// rg -A1 '(define PSNAME|proto_register_protocol[^_])' $(git diff --name-only v4.4.16.. | rg packet- | sort -u)\n+// rg -A1 '(define PSNAME|proto_register_protocol[^_])' $(git diff --name-only v4.4.18.. | rg packet- | sort -u)\n [commaize]\n --\n+BT ATT\n+BT AVRCP\n+BT BR/EDR RF\n+BT HFP\n+C12.22\n+CMS\n+ESS\n+FP\n+H.245\n+Kerberos\n+Rlogin\n+SSH\n+X.509AF\n+X.509IF\n --\n \n === New and Updated Capture File Support\n@@ -69,6 +97,15 @@ There are no new protocols in this release.\n // Add one file type per line between the -- delimiters.\n [commaize]\n --\n+3gpp phone log\n+Busmaster\n+Catapult DCT2000\n+Daintree SNA\n+Endace ERF\n+pcapng\n+RTPDump\n+Sniffer\n+Tektronix K12xx\n --\n \n === New and Updated File Format Decoding Support\n",
